      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In Entra ID, external identities\nallow people outside your\norganization to access your apps\nand resources.\n\n--> This by letting them\nsign in using whatever identity they prefer.",
